 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16_drm.rs      | 16 ++++++
 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16_runtime.rs  | 83 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16_timeline.rs | 55 +++++++++++++++---
 4 files changed, 148 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

